      "context_excerpt": "The NVIDIA Blueprint for smart city AI — announced in June at NVIDIA GTC Paris — combines digital twins with NVIDIA Omniverse libraries, synthetic data generation, AI model training with vision language models ( VLMs ) and video analytics AI agents using the NVIDIA Blueprint for video search and summarization (VSS).",
